{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537218, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42189, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788091519, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537218, "buffs": {"131": [[1083362, 131, 64312853, 150058, 1787910267, 1788169467, 11, 0]]}}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879154978, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 116, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879154045,47288722,1280]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67272415]lagugu111[/uid] (2026-08-21 15:05):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大终于承认国产链不如海外链了，快给你那追光的朋友道个歉吧。[/quote]<br/>你有病吧<br/>他买的易中天加起来平均30% 还是天带起来的<br/>我光做半导体ETF都45%收益了", "lou": 440, "content_length": 78, "reply_to": 879154045, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787296354}, {"pid": 879155404, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879155057,47288722,1281]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-21 15:13):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:pg:转身]但是机构资金的斜率和大盘的涨跌是可以对起来的&amp;#160;[/quote]<br/>机构他就不能买银行吗?那个机构你分得清楚是GJD的常态化社保资金还是机构主力做多？<br/>你分不清楚的。不懂分解盘口的看那个等同于瞎子摸象。", "lou": 441, "content_length": 133, "reply_to": 879155057, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787296564}, {"pid": 879155702, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 96, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:18", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879155414,47288722,1282]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=222457]格里非斯[/uid] (2026-08-21 15:16):[/b]<br/><br/>这里没明白，狼大说的“等周一确认安全再说 万一低开 那就等于做了个反T”，意思是如果周一低开，再把今天尾盘减掉的仓位打回去吗？形成一个隔日反T。但狼大之前不是说过半导体接下来只有卖没有买吗？这里不太懂[s:ac:呆][/quote]<br/>如果周末利空 或者今晚美股大跌  今天卖的仓位就回去<br/>这波还没吃完<br/>所以如果周一-3%开 那不是等同于做了个3个点的T吗<br/>我没有说这波我吃完了的。<br/>这种地量不值得我割肉 我的策略就没有这个量能割过肉。", "lou": 442, "content_length": 182, "reply_to": 879155414, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787296710}, {"pid": 879155864, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 108, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "而且我是什么时候说的不做海外链<br/>MD不要前朝的剑来斩当朝的官啊<br/>那20%-30%的下跌不算在里面的？", "lou": 443, "content_length": 87, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787296788}, {"pid": 879156145, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879155954,47288722,1283]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=12157069]血色夏日[/uid] (2026-08-21 15:20):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，这两天有色持续流入，今天还放量了，后续有走主升的潜质吗？[/quote]<br/>那是贵金属的流入 跟别的有色没有关系啊<br/>贵金属是黄金的延申<br/>你这么想就行了。", "lou": 444, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 879155954, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787296920}, {"pid": 879157204, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 60, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-21 15:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879156688,47288722,1284]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67273693]小土豆二号机[/uid] (2026-08-21 15:26):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，如果周一直接打到止损位是不是就把剩下的仓位也出掉了，等c杀结束再买入[/quote]<br/>缩量这么大怎么打下去", "lou": 445, "content_length": 25, "reply_to": 879156688, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787297435}, {"pid": 879422121, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 155, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "温和放量  既然今天光存大跌<br/>那半导体这块就跌不了多少。<br/>量就这么多。", "lou": 446, "content_length": 62, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787537081}, {"pid": 879422669, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 115, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879422264,47288722,1320]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=793331]圣印[/uid] (2026-08-24 10:05):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大还要不要加回来，什么时候加回来呢？磕头[/quote]<br/>要么指数3870以下破位放出恐慌盘加 要么光存止跌后半导体强于这俩向上增量的时候加<br/>既然都过了周末 找个确定的地方买不更好么", "lou": 447, "content_length": 119, "reply_to": 879422264, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787537330}, {"pid": 879423596, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 148, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:15", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这里重点是 能不能放量2000E以上 不然半导体也只是比光存相对安全<br/>不是代表他有挣钱机会<br/>买的理由从来不是他不跌 <br/>而是他能涨。", "lou": 448, "content_length": 113, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787537718}, {"pid": 879424712, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 105, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "药这个走势和时间点  和之前半导体见顶后接了一波涛概念差不多", "lou": 449, "content_length": 56, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787538199}, {"pid": 879431472, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 140, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "跌破了 按计划打入。", "lou": 450, "content_length": 18, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787540907}, {"pid": 879432103, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879431744,47288722,1335]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67308663]stybb[/uid] (2026-08-24 11:10):[/b]<br/><br/>打入哪里[/quote]<br/>我上周T出去的仓位啊<br/>上周不是说了么  吃多一个-3%。<br/>现在不是刚好么", "lou": 451, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 879431744, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787541151}, {"pid": 879432532, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 215, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我哪句话不是提前说的？<br/>上周说这部分仓位吃个-3%的差价 <br/>今早说 要么跌破3870 要么先于光企稳放量上<br/>那刚才不是出现了么  <br/>刚才不是跌破3870了嘛 不是继续放量了嘛<br/>这不是我计划内吗<br/>我哪句话是临时说的？", "lou": 452, "content_length": 179, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787541298}, {"pid": 879435181, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 183, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "还有 关于宏观方面<br/>确认银行存款暂时不会出来了 因为地方化债速度不及预期<br/>所以楼市 股市甚至债市都不会有大行情<br/>这些钱只能在存款和城投债里滚动直到把大部分旧债换成新债<br/><br/>所以你们知道股市为什么上去不行 下来也不行就行了。", "lou": 453, "content_length": 202, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787542293}, {"pid": 879436609, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879435883,47288722,1343]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67182191]富多多[/uid] (2026-08-24 11:36):[/b]<br/><br/>?<br/>狼大 上不去的逻辑我懂 下不去的逻辑是不能让场子砸了没地方化债 所以又托又拖等新钱？[/quote]<br/><br/>信心", "lou": 454, "content_length": 9, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879435883, "postdatetimestamp": 1787542877}, {"pid": 879437190, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 88, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:45", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879436995,47288722,1345]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=6313142]暮残[/uid] (2026-08-24 11:44):[/b]<br/><br/>科创50 月线绿了<br/>狼大这次科创修复这么弱，是不是也是缺钱相关<br/>修复了光没钱也没量去修复像村龙寒武纪一样的大票了[/quote]<br/><br/>因为这是反弹 一次会比一次弱<br/>只有主升才会一次比一次强<br/>谁给你的主升预期你找谁去", "lou": 456, "content_length": 79, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879436995, "postdatetimestamp": 1787543125}, {"pid": 879447411, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 186, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:15", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "反正现在也没什么事 除了等就是等<br/>我希望输出我的一个观点<br/>我仍然认为这里是科技的ABC的B反而已<br/><br/>就像你手里自由下落一个兵乓球 每一次反弹都会弱于前一次<br/>如果想他弹得更高或者反转<br/>要么向上吹，要么用更大的力量下砸。也就是外部力量打破规律。<br/>如果要自然的重新走起来，那筹码集中度和交易频率必须降下来<br/>也就是之前最高的时候光和半导体加起来是市场50%成交量，现在最多降低到40%以下而已<br/>要降到合理必须是25%-30%这个区间才有可能达到第二次重新走起来的状态<br/>资金不会说谎。<br/>所以这里我不会预期很高的。每一次都是吃点就吃点。", "lou": 457, "content_length": 481, "14": {"13": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787548509}, {"pid": 879448108, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 64, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879447931,47288722,1350]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61422464]kaiserDu[/uid] (2026-08-24 13:20):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，这波4000诱多概率是不是会下降很多，目前看这波调整走abc，b浪构成一个调整中枢，现在是不是c段运行中？[/quote]<br/>不会<br/>最好的诱多点位一定是破4000<br/>你自己画个图就行了  <br/>一旦破4000 那就是典型的非常标准的  W底突破的右侧买点。<br/>那个地方才是诱多最好的位置<br/>现在2WE的成交量诱谁了  谁会进去？", "lou": 458, "content_length": 161, "reply_to": 879447931, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787548949}, {"pid": 879448428, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 104, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这里横就是因为你们这些散户割不动了 也不买 也不卖  都不动<br/>机构又不愿意继续砸价格。<br/>大家就僵在这里了。<br/>磨到出量就知道是什么情况了。", "lou": 459, "content_length": 122, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787549166}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283264, "replies": 35763, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788164891, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "风涧竹月", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788164899, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788161278, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "subject": false, "pid": null, "tid": 47206901, "fid": 510567}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 354, "fid": 510567, "14": {"14": 4, "13": 10, "17": 3, "12": 2, "11": 2, "10": 2, "15": 1}, "16": "63818397,64626166,67237704,12432602,67246750,27036967,40767826", "17": ",878690206,878734594,877971519,879712183"}, "this_visit_rows": 674}, "__F": {"name": "杂谈"}, "__R__ROWS": 19, "__R__ROWS_PAGE": 20, "__ROWS": 674, "__PAGE": 23}, "time": 1788164918}